# SuperMax root Vault - local/runtime exclusions
# Publishable/syncable content intentionally NOT ignored: /tasks, /drafts, /translate-cache
# Root-anchored patterns without trailing slash ignore the directory entry itself.
# (?d) allows Syncthing to delete already-synced ignored paths on other devices.
# Sync owner: WSL/Linux-native projects use WSL Syncthing; Windows-mounted projects use Windows Syncthing.

# Obsidian local state
/.obsidian/workspace.json
/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
/.obsidian/workspace*.json
/.obsidian/hotkeys.json
(?d)/.obsidian/cache
(?d)/.obsidian/cache/**
(?d)/.trash
(?d)/.trash/**

# Syncthing runtime/version data
(?d)/.stversions
(?d)/.stversions/**
/.stfolder

# SuperMax runtime/local zones
(?d)/skills
(?d)/skills/**
(?d)/fragments
(?d)/fragments/**
(?d)/tmp
(?d)/tmp/**
(?d)/history
(?d)/history/**
(?d)/artifacts
(?d)/artifacts/**
(?d)/handoff
(?d)/handoff/**
(?d)/e2e
(?d)/e2e/**

# Retired v0 Vault path; must not be reintroduced under the v1 root Vault
(?d)/knowledge
(?d)/knowledge/**
